{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/58073-new-st-looking-for-tips","id":58073,"title":"New ST looking for tips","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-26T07:29:47-08:00","id":58073,"title":"New ST looking for tips","content":"So Iv read all the books twice poured over tons of myths and read Percy Jackson.Im gonna be running my first game soon with a group of fellow newbies and was hoping for some tips on providing a good experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2107-wiwuno","name":"Wiwuno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T10:21:01-08:00","id":58165,"title":"","content":"The best tip? Make sure that you and your players are on the same page. Tell them the kind of game you want to run and also listen to them on the type of game they want to play in. Do they and you want it to be political or mystery or action or whatever? Also, how far do you want to run it? From Hero to diety or else remain Hero or else start out as Demigods? Make sure that all of you want the same thing out of the chronicle. Work with each other on this all the way through character creation and then the game will run smooth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}